# Library ▸ Easels ▸ Delete: everything showing the easel closes, its tab and the Peek Library opened it in
# (AppDelegate.closeEasel, which a delete synced from another Mac goes through too).
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://action/newEasel
wait 2
cra://debug?browserWindows=made
expect-log Cra browser windows made: kind=normal .*tabs=\[easel://[0-9A-F-]{36}\]
cra://action/viewEasels
wait 1
cra://debug?easelTile=open
wait 1.5
cra://debug?peeks=open
expect-log Cra peeks open: shown easel://[0-9A-F-]{36}$
cra://debug?easelTile=delete
wait 0.5
cra://debug?answerDialog=Delete
expect-log dialog Are you sure you want to delete this Easel\? answered Delete
wait 1.5
cra://debug?peeks=deleted
expect-log Cra peeks deleted: none$
cra://debug?browserWindows=deleted
expect-log Cra browser windows deleted: kind=normal .*tabs=\[\] open=
